# Self-driving reports

## Report (`system.signal_reports`)

Reports contain findings, research summaries, and impact metrics for a project.
Deleted reports are excluded. Task read access is required.

### Columns

{{ schema_columns('system.signal_reports') }}

## Report artifact (`system.signal_report_artifacts`)

Artifacts record findings, judgments, notes, and work on a report.
Deleted reports and staff-only ranking scores are excluded. Task read access is required.

### Columns

{{ schema_columns('system.signal_report_artifacts') }}

### Relationships

Join `report_id` to `system.signal_reports.id`.
Artifacts are log entries. For the current judgment, use the latest entry of that type by `created_at`.

### Example

```sql
SELECT r.id, r.title, r.status, a.type, a.content, a.created_at
FROM system.signal_reports AS r
JOIN system.signal_report_artifacts AS a ON a.report_id = r.id
ORDER BY a.created_at DESC
LIMIT 20
```
